			]
			description: [
				"Infinite ore veins need special equipment and preporation to gather."
				""
				"There exist some vanilla and modded veins from Thermal and Mekanism."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lOre Vein Finder&r will help you seek for infinite ore veins that you will be able to drill for &oendless supply&r of various resources!"
				""
				"When you in chunk with ore vein use &lSample Drill&r to collect information about vein type. Drill need filled Air Tank on top to work."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Just click Sample Drill with &lAtlas&r after it finishes. Atlas save information about the ore veins you find: it will show type and coordinates of the vein. "
				""
				"You can additionally filter what veins you don't want to search next time. It can be helpful if you want to find a new resources."
			]
			id: "2EF4C6591798F00E"
